01:06:01.990 --> 01:06:06.740
<v Interpreter>They would just, like, drive around, like, without knowing absolutely anything-- totally like idiots.
<v Interpreter>他们就像是，开车到处转，就像，根本不知道绝对任何事情——完全就像白痴。

01:06:06.740 --> 01:06:11.740
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
